---
import DocsLayout from '../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import Callout from '../components/Callout.astro';
import WhyIllustration from '../components/why/WhyIllustration.astro';
import OnboardingWizard from '../components/why/OnboardingWizard.astro';
import { url } from '../data/site';
---

<DocsLayout title="VibeCrew">

  <!-- ── Section 1: Personal story ─────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="section" id="origin">
    <Callout type="info" title="Why this exists">
      <div class="origin-content">
        <div class="origin-text">
          <p>Born from painful experience. Before building this system, the creator tried vibe-coding without a plan &mdash; wrong tech stack three features deep, context windows filling mid-feature, token bills from re-explaining context, output that looked fine in demos but fell apart in production.</p>
          <p>VibeCrew encodes every one of those lessons into an automated system, so you don&rsquo;t have to learn them the hard way.</p>
        </div>
        <WhyIllustration name="before-vibecrew" size="card" />
      </div>
    </Callout>
  </section>

  <!-- ── Section 3: Parallel workflow ──────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="section" id="parallel">
    <h3>Work on everything at once</h3>
    <WhyIllustration name="parallel-workflow" size="hero" />
    <p>Picture this &mdash; you&rsquo;re planning the next feature for Project A while VibeCrew is coding Project B and running tests on Project C. Three projects, all progressing. When an agent finishes, needs a decision, or hits a problem &mdash; a notification takes you straight to the right tab. The rest of the time? Silence. Your attention goes exactly where it&rsquo;s needed, when it&rsquo;s needed.</p>
  </section>

  <!-- ── Section 4: The hard parts, handled ────────────────────── -->
  <section class="section" id="hard-parts">
    <h3>The hard parts, handled</h3>
    <p>VibeCrew takes care of everything that makes AI-generated code unreliable.</p>

    <div class="why-cards">
      <div class="card why-card">
        <WhyIllustration name="foundation" size="card" />
        <div class="why-card-body">
          <h4><span class="card-icon green">&#9670;</span> Architecture before code</h4>
          <p>Vision, design system, tech stack, and architecture are established before any code is written. A phase gate enforces this &mdash; no shortcuts. Solid foundation from day one.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card why-card">
        <WhyIllustration name="auto-quality" size="card" />
        <div class="why-card-body">
          <h4><span class="card-icon blue">&#9670;</span> Quality on autopilot</h4>
          <p>Tests, linting, type checking, build verification, code review, and security auditing run automatically. You don&rsquo;t need to know what ESLint is &mdash; every feature meets production standards before reaching your main branch.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card why-card">
        <WhyIllustration name="patterns" size="card" />
        <div class="why-card-body">
          <h4><span class="card-icon purple">&#9670;</span> Patterns that convert</h4>
          <p>Built-in UI and business pattern libraries teach agents what production-quality means. Forms get proper error states. Pricing pages use tiered anchoring. Onboarding follows proven conversion funnels.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card why-card">
        <WhyIllustration name="token-cost" size="card" />
        <div class="why-card-body">
          <h4><span class="card-icon amber">&#9670;</span> Tokens spent wisely</h4>
          <p>Worktree isolation keeps research tokens separate from your main session. MCP servers replace pasting docs. Zero-token hooks enforce rules without spending a single token. Forced compaction between features prevents context rot. Free and open source &mdash; works with Claude Pro, Max, or API.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── Section 5: How it works (accordion) ───────────────────── -->
  <section class="section" id="how-it-works">
    <h3>How it works</h3>
    <p>Type slash commands, agents do the work, you get notified when needed. Here&rsquo;s what&rsquo;s under the hood.</p>

    <details class="how-details">
      <summary>Smart context management</summary>
      <div class="how-answer">
        <WhyIllustration name="context-mgmt" size="accordion" />
        <p>Worktree isolation keeps research tokens separate. Forced compaction between features prevents context rot. MCP servers replace pasting docs. You never hit the context wall.</p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="how-details">
      <summary>The Performance Coach</summary>
      <div class="how-answer">
        <WhyIllustration name="vibe-score" size="accordion" />
        <p>Every session gets a Vibe Score. The coach identifies waste, proposes a rule to prevent it, and writes it permanently with your approval. Each session more efficient than the last.</p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="how-details">
      <summary>The Interrupt Protocol</summary>
      <div class="how-answer">
        <WhyIllustration name="interrupt" size="accordion" />
        <p>Terminal stays silent during work. OS notifications fire only on: permission needed, task complete, critical error. One-click deep link to the exact tab.</p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="how-details">
      <summary>Adapts to you</summary>
      <div class="how-answer">
        <WhyIllustration name="profiles" size="accordion" />
        <p>Run <code>/profile</code> &mdash; a 2-minute interview or pick a preset. Personalizes verbosity, autonomy, PR format, code comments, risk tolerance. The system meets you where you are.</p>
      </div>
    </details>
  </section>

  <!-- ── Section 6: Getting started (onboarding wizard) ────────── -->
  <section class="section" id="getting-started">
    <h3>Get started in minutes</h3>
    <p>Answer 3 quick questions and get a personalized setup guide &mdash; only the steps that apply to you.</p>

    <OnboardingWizard />
  </section>

  <!-- ── Section 7: Community ──────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="section" id="community">
    <h3>Built with the community</h3>
    <p>VibeCrew is open source and shaped by the people who use it. Your feedback, ideas, and projects make it better for everyone.</p>

    <div class="community-grid">
      <div class="card community-card">
        <div class="card-icon accent">&#128172;</div>
        <h4>Propose a feature</h4>
        <p>Have an idea that would make VibeCrew better? Open a GitHub issue. The best features come from real workflows.</p>
        <a href="https://github.com/fabkrum/vibe-crew/issues/new?labels=enhancement&template=feature_request.md" class="community-link">Open a feature request &rarr;</a>
      </div>

      <div class="card community-card">
        <div class="card-icon red">&#128027;</div>
        <h4>Report a problem</h4>
        <p>Found a bug or something that doesn&rsquo;t work right? File an issue and we&rsquo;ll fix it. Include your <code>/status</code> output for faster diagnosis.</p>
        <a href="https://github.com/fabkrum/vibe-crew/issues/new?labels=bug&template=bug_report.md" class="community-link">Report an issue &rarr;</a>
      </div>

      <div class="card community-card">
        <div class="card-icon green">&#127942;</div>
        <h4>Share what you built</h4>
        <p>Built something with VibeCrew? Show it off! Share your project to inspire others and help us showcase what&rsquo;s possible.</p>
        <a href="https://github.com/fabkrum/vibe-crew/discussions/categories/show-and-tell" class="community-link">Share your project &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── Section 8: CTA ────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="section" id="cta">
    <Callout type="tip" title="What do you want to build next?">
      <p>A SaaS product? A marketplace? A tool? VibeCrew handles architecture, testing, review, docs, and cost tracking. You bring the vision.</p>
    </Callout>
    <div class="why-cta">
      <a class="hero-btn primary" href={url('/quick-start.html')}>Get Started &rarr;</a>
      <a class="hero-btn secondary" href={url('/example-session.html')}>See an Example Session</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</DocsLayout>

<style>
  /* ── Hero SVG centering ──────────────────────────────────── */
  .section :global(.why-illustration--hero) {
    margin: 1.5rem auto;
  }

  /* ── Origin callout layout ───────────────────────────────── */
  .origin-content {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .origin-text {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .origin-content :global(.why-illustration--card) {
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .origin-content {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
    }
  }

  /* ── Card grid for "hard parts" ──────────────────────────── */
  .why-cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .why-cards {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .why-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 1.25rem;
  }

  .why-card :global(.why-illustration--card) {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .why-card-body h4 {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .why-card-body p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .card-icon {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    margin-right: 0.25rem;
  }
  .card-icon.green { color: var(--color-green); }
  .card-icon.blue { color: var(--color-blue); }
  .card-icon.purple { color: var(--color-accent); }
  .card-icon.amber { color: var(--color-amber); }
  .card-icon.accent { color: var(--color-accent); }
  .card-icon.red { color: var(--color-red); }

  /* ── Accordion (how it works) ────────────────────────────── */
  .how-details {
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .how-details summary {
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text);
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    transition: background 0.15s;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .how-details summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }

  .how-details summary::after {
    content: '+';
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    transition: transform 0.2s;
  }

  .how-details[open] summary::after {
    content: '\2212';
  }

  .how-details summary:hover {
    background: var(--color-surface);
  }

  .how-answer {
    padding: 0 1.25rem 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .how-answer :global(.why-illustration--accordion) {
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .how-answer p {
    margin: 0;
    flex: 1;
    padding-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .how-answer {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .how-answer p {
      padding-top: 0;
    }
  }

  /* ── Community grid ──────────────────────────────────────── */
  .community-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .community-card {
    padding: 1.25rem;
  }

  .community-card .card-icon {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    display: block;
  }

  .community-card h4 {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .community-card p {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .community-link {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .community-link:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  /* ── CTA buttons ─────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .why-cta {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .hero-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 0.15s, border-color 0.15s;
  }

  .hero-btn.primary {
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .hero-btn.primary:hover {
    background: var(--color-accent-dim);
  }

  .hero-btn.secondary {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    color: var(--color-text);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .hero-btn.secondary:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }
</style>
